<div class="title">Faculty Support Grants</div>

<div class="container">

<p class="inline-7d27179924">
  A limited number of partial-travel support grants are available
  for faculty attending iSES {{ site.year }}, subject to the
  availability of funds.
</p>

<p class="inline-7d27179924">
  Shortlisted faculty candidates will be notified and must
  register for the conference by paying the eligible registration fee.
  Participants with partial funding from their respective
  organizations will be given preference.
</p>

<p class="inline-7d27179924">
  <strong>Travel and Accommodation Support:</strong>
  Faculty support grants are subject to the availability of funds
  and applicable government travel norms.
</p>

<p class="inline-7d27179924">
  Applicants must indicate the specific type of support required:
  <strong>Travel, Accommodation, or Both</strong>.
  This will help us extend support to a larger number of participants.
</p>

<p class="inline-7d27179924">
  <strong>Important:</strong>
  Submission of a Faculty Support Grant application does not
  guarantee approval or sanction of the grant.
  All grants are subject to the availability of funds and
  fulfillment of the eligibility requirements.
</p>

